## User Flow Diagram

```
User opens terminal
  │
  ├─ `aa help` ──► cmd_help() ──► banner() + usage text
  │                                 ⚠ No examples shown
  │
  ├─ `aa install` ──► NO CONFIRMATION ──► Builds ALL tools
  │                    🔴 Missing gate       (minutes, no progress)
  │
  ├─ `aa status` ──► cmd_status() ──► ANSI table
  │                                    ⚠ Misaligned columns
  │                                    ⚠ Color-only status
  │
  ├─ `aa run <tool>` ──► executable_path()
  │     ├─ Found ──► exec binary
  │     └─ Missing ──► err + suggest install
  │                     🟡 No "install now?" prompt
  │
  ├─ `aa uninstall --all` ──► NO CONFIRMATION ──► Removes everything
  │                            🔴 Missing gate
  │
  └─ `aa reset` ──► Warns ──► Prompts "Type RESET"
                   🟡 Doesn't list what's destroyed
```

